  "Category": "Developer Tools",
  "Description": "God Mode provides developers with tools, diagnostics and in-depth insights into their Umbraco site. This custom tree in the Settings section of Umbraco allows you to browse, query and search your document types and compositions; your templates and partials; your datatypes and property editors; your media library; your custom controllers, services and models. It also provides diagnostics about your Umbraco set-up and the server it is running on.",
